irection marker (towards/to)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">へ</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"もどる\" data-defn=\"to turn back (e.g. half-way); to return/to go back\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">戻る</span><rt>もどる</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ので\" data-defn=\"that being the case/because of .../the reason is .../given that ...\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">ので</span><rt></rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ペキン\" data-defn=\"Beijing (China)/Peking\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">北京</span><rt>ペキン</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"に\" data-defn=\"target / time / direction marker (to/at/in)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">に</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"つい\" data-defn=\"to arrive at/to reach; to sit on/to sit at (e.g. the table) (着く)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">着い</span><rt>つい</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"たら\" data-defn=\"if / when (conditional)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">たら</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"あっ\" data-defn=\"to meet/to encounter/to see; to have an accident/to have a bad experience (会う)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">会っ</span><rt>あっ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"て\" data-defn=\"conjunctive particle (and / -ing)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">て</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"はなし\" data-defn=\"to talk/to speak/to converse/to chat; to tell/to explain/to narrate/to mention/to des (話す)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">話し</span><rt>はなし</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"たい\" data-defn=\"want to (verbal suffix of desire)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">たい</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"と\" data-defn=\"and / with\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">と</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"かい\" data-defn=\